    {
      "id": "meShpFzd755EuezRUkYB1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 472,
      "width": 778,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 644044951,
      "version": 353,
      "versionNonce": 1257395289,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792750317631,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "These names are based upon the position of root node in the final output\n\nSo in Pre-order we have Root dispalyed first followed by Left and then Right .\n\nIn In-order, we have Left , followed by Root and then Right .\n\nAnd in Post-order we have Left, Right and finally Root .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "These names are based upon the position of root node in the final output\n\nSo in Pre-order we have Root dispalyed first followed by Left and then Right .\n\nIn In-order, we have Left , followed by Root and then Right .\n\nAnd in Post-order we have Left, Right and finally Root .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bP-GzxAiKWT8AH6oNxbSN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -36,
      "y": 807,
      "width": 684,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 703389657,
      "version": 693,
      "versionNonce": 1975117145,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792753998199,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Algorithm for preorder\n---------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the tree is empty or not .\n\n2. If it is empty print tree is empty and return .\n\n3. If tree is not empty then Set the Pointer to the root node ande :\n\n a. print it \n\n b. If it has right child push it in the stack .\n\n c. Move towards left .\n\n\n4. Repeat the above step(3) untill pointer becomes null .\n\n5. If the pointer is null , then check the Stack .\n\n6. If stack is empty then then finisg .\n\n7. Otherwise :\n  a. POP the top element .\n\n  b. Go to step 3a .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Algorithm for preorder\n---------------------------\n\n1. Check whether the tree is empty or not .\n\n2. If it is empty print tree is empty and return .\n\n3. If tree is not empty then Set the Pointer to the root node ande :\n\n a. print it \n\n b. If it has right child push it in the stack .\n\n c. Move towards left .\n\n\n4. Repeat the above step(3) untill pointer becomes null .\n\n5. If the pointer is null , then check the Stack .\n\n6. If stack is empty then then finisg .\n\n7. Otherwise :\n  a. POP the top element .\n\n  b. Go to step 3a .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
